### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@email = testuser@example.com
@password = Password123!

### 1. Register User
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Paste JWT token from Login response below:
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ0Y190aW1lY2Fwc3VsZSIsInN1YiI6ImFkMDlkZTQ3LThjZjMtNGJlMi05MzBlLWVmNTA0MzdlOGM5NSIsImV4cCI6MTc4ODk5MTc3MSwiaWF0IjoxNzg4OTA1MzcxfQ.8jSVzRqLn4AUUuDJ_eAhAOshlLtDcMYSjDpuct8LKs0




### 3. Create a Video (Seed DB)
# @name createVideo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"
}

### Paste the video ID returned from Step 3 below:
@videoId = 8a570e9f-c92a-4e2f-a062-35e2cc246939


### enrich video, to set status
POST {{host}}/api/v1/videos/8a570e9f-c92a-4e2f-a062-35e2cc246939/enrich
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"Title": "the chris watts case",
	"Description": "family annihilator"
}



### create a case
POST {{host}}/api/v1/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"Title": "the chris watts case",
	"Description": "family annihilator"
}

### attach milestone to case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cases/13c9317e-f634-4e5d-8ba2-0da09903195e/milestones
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Disappearance Reported",
  "description": "Shanann Watts reported missing by her friend Nickole Atkinson after missed doctor appointments.",
  "event_date": "2018-08-13T12:00:00Z"
}

### list unlinked videos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/videos/unlinked
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### list linked videos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/videos/linked
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### get cases
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cases
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### get milestones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cases/13c9317e-f634-4e5d-8ba2-0da09903195e/milestones
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### attach video to milestone
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/milestones/74ddbb76-d8f4-4596-98a2-44abf00e2892/videos/8a570e9f-c92a-4e2f-a062-35e2cc246939
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "youtube_video_id": "dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "title": "Police Bodycam: Initial Welfare Check",
  "channel_name": "True Crime Recaps",
  "status": "analyzed",
  "summary": "Officer arrival at the residence, initial walkthrough with Chris Watts, and early neighborhood canvassing.",
  "category": "Bodycam"
}

### get videos by milestone
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/milestones/74ddbb76-d8f4-4596-98a2-44abf00e2892/videos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Record Video Watch
POST {{host}}/api/v1/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "video_id": "{{videoId}}",
  "completed": true
}


### 5. Get Watch History
GET {{host}}/api/v1/watch/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}